      "value": "Except that we're already getting destroyed on sites like youtube by copyright claims on content that falls under those rules and nobody in government or at youtube cares. Frivolous and false claims go unpunished. Every copyright law made has been endlessly abused and we have no recourse. Now the EU has made the sites hosting our content directly responsible and legally liable for everything uploaded.",
